  "handle": "sofa-drip-pro-3-seater-sofa-fabric-coco-brown",
  "description": "<p>The Drip Pro Sofa brings together modern design, everyday comfort, and effortless style. With its sleek silhouette, inclined arm design, and elevated wooden-finish legs, this sofa is made to fit beautifully into your cute and cozy homes. Whether placed in your living room, lounge area, or home office, the Drip Pro adds style and savvy to your space.</p>\n\n<p>Sink into its plush, removable back cushions and supportive 4-inch foam seating paired with zig-zag springs that give you the perfect balance of soft and supportive. Movie marathons, lazy Sundays, work breaks, unexpected naps, the Drip Pro is built for all of it. The removable cushions can double up as comfy arm pillows when you just want to stretch out and relax.</p>\n\n<p>Built for modern living, the elevated legs make cleaning underneath quick and super easy, while the sturdy construction ensures long-lasting durability. Available in timeless Charcoal Grey and Coco Brown shades, the Drip Pro Sofa gives you and your room a subtle glow up.</p>\n\n<p>Comfortable, stylish, and thoughtfully designed, the Drip Pro Sofa is the perfect spot for you, your pet or your friends. It is available in 1 seater, 2 seater and 3 seater options. Backed by a 3-year conditional warranty, it’s a sofa designed to look good and feel great for years to come.</p>",
